<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were weak to $0.50 Lower. Demand and movement was light to moderate. Top $55.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  54.00-55.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  50.00-54.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  45.00-50.00</p>
<p>Sows - weak/off $1.00. Top $48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-43.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 43.00-44.50</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs. 44.00-46.50 Few over 600 lbs.</p>
<p>47.00-48.00</p>
</text>
